; ================= Per-Zone Lighting (M13 first pass) =================
; Zone-tinted lights layered on top of the global WorldEnvironment (C5). Factory (zones 1-4):
; sodium/orange/red with cyan accents. Neon District (zones 5-10): magenta + cyan, with
; beat-pulsed stage_light.gd lights in zones 2, 3, 8 and 10. Fog/ambient per zone are tweened
; by ZoneAtmosphere (child of WorldEnvironment) on SignalBus.zone_entered.
